  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Born in Londinium, Victoria, Lava is the younger twin sister of her fellow Operator, Hibiscus. After contracting Oripathy, she came to Rhodes Island for treatment. She found the idea of saving lives appealing, and so volunteered for training.",
        "zh": "生于维多利亚的伦蒂尼姆，干员芙蓉的孪生妹妹。因为感染了矿石病来到了罗德岛。觉得付出努力拯救他人是一件很酷的事情，于是自愿加入了罗德岛的训练之中。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests have shown the outlines of her internal organs to be indistinct due to abnormal shadows. Originium granules have been detected in her circulatory system, confirming her to be infected with Oripathy.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 9.4%\nShe presents no obvious external symptoms of Oripathy.\n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.25 u/L\nDegree of infection is minor and has not had any physical impact.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】9.4%\n体表暂未出现明显的矿石病病征。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.25 u/L\n感染程度尚浅，暂时还没有带来明显身体影响。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Originium Arts Rating",
        "zh": "源石技艺评定",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Under the guidance of her Originium Arts instructor, Lava learned how to control basic Arts in less than a month despite never touching Originium before. Her methods are still rudimentary, and at present she can still only use simple flame conversions, but her stability and learning speed are astounding. If she trains for a long period of time, she may be able to reach a very high level.",
        "zh": "在源石技艺指导员的训练下，从来没接触过源石法术的炎熔在半个月内掌握了基础的法力控制。应用模式还较为单一和初级，现阶段还只能进行简单的火焰转化。但是其稳定性和学习速度令人叹为观止，如果再让其进行长时间的训练，可能会达到非常高的水准。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Unlike other stray children hiding in dark alleys, Lava was born into a relatively normal middle-class Victorian family. Lava believes that one must personally put in effort to help others, rather than stand at a distance. When she was young, she enjoyed working with the poor and the orphaned. She was very aware how much pain they suffered, which planted in her heart the seeds of compassion and justice.",
        "zh": "不同于混迹于阴暗小巷中的其他流浪的孩子，炎熔出生在并不算贫穷的维多利亚普通家庭里。比起站在远处，炎熔更相信去亲身去实践去行动才能够帮助他人。从小喜欢跟贫民和流浪的孤儿打交道的炎熔，心中很清楚，这些人们的生活中到底有多少痛苦的经历。也正是因此，小小的正义的种子早早的就在炎熔的心中生根发芽。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Lava is tough and ignores the advice of others when she moves into action. In fact, she is gentle and childlike at heart but prefers not to admit it to herself. Whenever anyone brings this up, she immediately changes the subject and tries to play it cool.",
        "zh": "嘴巴倔，做事一点都听不进去别人的指指点点。但是其实炎熔心中一直都有比谁都温柔和孩子气的一面，当然，炎熔自己绝对不会承认这件事就是了。这一点都不酷，每次炎熔都会说着这样的话结束这个话题。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    }
  ]
}
